// Engines are optional feature modules shipped as independent Go modules
// (see docs/engine.md). Enable one by adding a blank import below and
// running `go mod tidy`:
//
//	import (
//		_ "github.com/example/airway-im-engine"
//	)
//
// The engine's package init registers it with lib/engine; the framework then
// mounts its routes, boots it, and exposes its migrations and REPL models.
